license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - voynich-manuscript
  - cryptography
  - statistical-analysis
  - transcription
  - historical-linguistics
  - photonic-systems
abstract: >-
  Open verification framework for the Kelly Standard Transcription (KST) 
  methodology applied to the Voynich Manuscript (MS 408). This repository 
  provides tools for independent researchers to verify statistical claims 
  about transcription coverage, word frequency patterns, and CEVA-English 
  mapping probabilities without revealing proprietary translation mappings.
